specs/hal-engine-websocket-protocol/spec.md:536:          Server yields ToolEntry via entry_upsert
specs/hal-engine-websocket-protocol/spec.md:537:          Server executes tool
specs/hal-engine-websocket-protocol/spec.md:538:          Server re-queries model with tool result
specs/hal-engine-websocket-protocol/spec.md:540:Round 2:  Model streams text (possibly requests another tool)
